# Send the Docker build only what the Java builds need. Everything else (git history, IDE files,
# build output, results, secrets like .env) stays out: smaller context, faster builds, and nothing
# private ends up inside an image layer.
*
!pom.xml
!common
!ledger-core
!observability
!bank-service
!switch-service
!psp-service
!load-generator
!e2e-tests
**/target
